Subject: [PATCH 12/15] Phase 4: direct Anthropic API adapter (Sonnet 5.5
 sellers, Haiku 5.5 buyers) + WON arm

Native anthropic SDK 1.6.0; per-model thinking off (Sonnet between_tools/effort high, Haiku
disabled/effort medium); no sampling params; no fallbacks; refusals recorded and treated as
no-action turns; cost from verified price table; fail-closed on bad request / spend cap;
separate ledger. WON = messaging off from round 5, no announcement. 47/47 offline tests;
GPT-4.1 sweep analysis output unchanged.

